  "description": "Actor Jung Woo-Jin kills his co-star by firing a gun loaded with live bullets instead of a prop while filming a movie. Woo-Jin, who was only acting according to the script, appeals his innocence, but no one believes him. He then encounters Seo Ju-Yeon, who introduces herself as his sponsor, and his bodyguard Kwon Seung-Hyun... \n\n*\"Honestly, I feel like I'm going to faint just thinking about that time... when the bullet went through my heart.\"* \n\nCould this crazy person have done everything...?\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Bomtoon and Lezhin's Dulbodaneun Sen Danpyeonseon (둘보다는 셋 단편선) Collection.*",
